a nested sweep whose op fails at the outer sweep's second point and the inner's second: the vccs cancels out's conductance there (singular)
ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
model vamos_vsource vsource
model vamos_resistor resistor
model vamos_vccs vccs
V1 (in 0) vamos_vsource type="dc" dc=1
R1 (in out) vamos_resistor r=1000.0
R2 (out 0) vamos_resistor r=1000.0
G1 (out 0 out 0) vamos_vccs gain=0.001*(va*vb-6)
control
  options rawfile="ascii" strictoutput=0
  var va=1
  var vb=1
  save v(out)
  sweep so variable="va" values=[1, 2]
    sweep si variable="vb" values=[1, 2, 3]
      analysis op1 op
endc
